      "Context": "ConfigWindow.DrawCharacterSpecificSettings",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "The default filter for all characters is 'Hide Gear Set Items', but you may want to override this to hide all Armoury Chest items (regardless of whether they're part of a gear set) e.g. for your main character.",
      "Translated": "所有角色的默认筛选为“隐藏套装物品”，但你可能希望覆盖此设置以隐藏所有兵装库物品（无论它们是否属于套装），例如为你的主角色。",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.DrawCharacterSpecificSettings",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Ignore 'Minimum Seals to keep' setting",
      "Translated": "忽略“保留最少军票”设置",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.DrawCharacterSpecificSettings",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "When enabled, all GC seals will be spent. This is effectively the same as setting 'Minimum Seals to keep' to 0.",
      "Translated": "启用后，所有军票都会被消耗。这实际上等同于将“保留最少军票”设为 0。",
